iction (forces a stalled health check); `INTARSIA_DEBUG_STALL_KV=n` sleeps n seconds after
allocating KV (forces a stalled health check); `INTARSIA_DEBUG_STALL_KV_FAIL=n` sleeps n seconds
after allocating KV and then returns an allocation error (forces a 503 from the HTTP layer).

